==Battleground==
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Try using your cats wisely along with heavy hitters such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], [[Nurse Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Nurse Cat]], and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] to stall the Aku Gories and Camelle that come out when the base is hit.

